<article><header class="article-heading"><a class="back-link" href="<%= url_for('/archives/') %>">手记索引 / NOTES</a><div class="meta"><time datetime="<%= date_xml(page.date) %>"><%= date(page.date,'YYYY.MM.DD') %></time><span><%= config.author %></span><% if(page.starter){ %><span class="sample-label">可删除的起步示例</span><% } %></div><h1><%= page.title %></h1><% if(page.summary){ %><p><%= page.summary %></p><% } %></header><div class="reading-layout"><aside class="toc"><span class="kicker">CONTENTS / 目录</span><%- toc(page.content,{list_number:true}) %></aside><div class="article-body"><%- page.content %><div class="article-tags"><% page.tags.each(t=>{ %><a href="<%= url_for(t.path) %>"># <%= t.name %></a><% }); %></div><nav class="post-navigation" aria-label="文章导航"><% if(page.prev){ %><a href="<%= url_for(page.prev.path) %>">上一篇：<%= page.prev.title %></a><% } if(page.next){ %><a href="<%= url_for(page.next.path) %>">下一篇：<%= page.next.title %></a><% } %><a href="<%= url_for('/archives/') %>">回到全部手记 ＋</a></nav></div><aside class="reading-note"><span>READ /<br>REFLECT /<br>REPEAT.</span><div class="reading-rule"></div><p>研究过程<br>也值得被记录。</p></aside></div></article>